{"reference":"2 Chronicles 5","book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":5,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"chapter_overview","title":"Overview","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"This chapter stands at the culmination of the account of Solomon’s wisdom and temple building as the completion of David’s preparations. The finished temple, the bringing in of the ark, and the filling of the house with God’s glory form the culminating movement before the dedication events that follow.","verse_refs":["2 Chronicles 5:1-14"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_chronicles_005_34853f6233a8e25740fe67aa"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}